  "flock.journeys.customLimit.title": "One custom journey at a time",
  "flock.journeys.dayShort": "Day",
  "flock.journeys.diet.disclaimer": "Kya & Co. helps you keep track of {{name}}'s weight and progress during the switch, but it isn't a substitute for your avian vet. The tips and alerts here are general guidance, not medical advice, so please lean on your vet for decisions about {{name}}'s health and diet.",
  "flock.journeys.diet.eclectus": "Eclectus have specific food needs. They generally do best on plenty of fresh vegetables and fruit, and many avian vets advise caution with heavily fortified pellets and added vitamins. Please make a plan with your avian vet before changing {{name}}'s food.",
  "flock.journeys.diet.findVet": "Find an avian vet",
  "flock.journeys.diet.howTo": "How to make it work",
  "flock.journeys.diet.nectar": "This journey isn't made for {{name}}. Lories and lorikeets eat a nectar-based diet, so their food needs are different. Your avian vet is the best guide for any changes.",
  "flock.journeys.diet.reminder": "Have you had a chance to check in with your avian vet? It's worth doing before the new food becomes a bigger share.",
  "flock.journeys.diet.reminderLater": "Remind me later",
  "flock.journeys.diet.reminderYes": "Yes, we've talked",
  "flock.journeys.diet.talked": "I've talked with our avian vet",
  "flock.journeys.diet.vetBody": "Changing your bird's diet is one of the best things you can do for them. It's also something to take slowly, with their health as the top priority the whole way. Before you start, check in with your avian vet to make sure your bird is healthy enough for a diet change. They can make sure the new diet gives your bird the nutrition it needs, tell you how much to feed, and help you spot trouble early. Some species also have specific dietary needs, which is another great reason to talk with your vet first.",
  "flock.journeys.diet.vetTitle": "Bring your avian vet in on this one",
  "flock.journeys.diet.willCall": "I'll call before we go further",
  "flock.journeys.diet.young": "Young birds still learning to eat on their own need food available all day, so please talk with your vet before changing anything.",
  "flock.journeys.empty.basics": "Stories about the everyday foundations, like diet changes, sleep, and stepping up, will collect here.",
  "flock.journeys.empty.basicsTitle": "No basics journeys yet",
  "flock.journeys.empty.followingTitle": "Not following anyone yet",
  "flock.journeys.empty.followingUpdates": "Follow a member's journey and each update they share will show up here.",
  "flock.journeys.empty.forYouSkills": "Journeys are members' stories of teaching their birds: a new trick, a calmer vet visit, a better diet. The first ones will appear here.",
  "flock.journeys.empty.forYouTitle": "No journeys yet",
  "flock.journeys.empty.tricks": "Training stories, from a first target touch to a reliable recall, will collect here.",
  "flock.journeys.empty.tricksTitle": "No trick journeys yet",
  "flock.journeys.filterAria": "Filter journeys",
