  "flock.journeys.finished.tipQ": "What would you tell someone just starting?",
  "flock.journeys.flockOnly.about": "The Flock is The Kya Project's community, where you'll find your local chapter, a library of guides and recordings, and every training journey, including tricks, nail trims, and stationing.",
  "flock.journeys.flockOnly.aboutCommunity": "The Flock is The Kya Project's community, where you'll find your local chapter, a library of guides and recordings, and other members' journeys.",
