  "flock.walkthrough.back": "Back",
  "flock.walkthrough.close": "Close",
  "flock.walkthrough.next": "Next",
  "flock.walkthrough.one.advocateTitle": "What we advocate for",
  "flock.walkthrough.one.bridgeBody": "The Flock brings these communities together. Our care recommendations come from avian research and veterinary science, and our mission is a place where all of us collaborate.",
  "flock.walkthrough.one.bridgeTitle": "Bridging research and life with birds",
  "flock.walkthrough.one.conservationists": "Conservationists",
  "flock.walkthrough.one.diet": "We advocate for fresh foods and a quality pellet.",
  "flock.walkthrough.one.dietTitle": "A varied, fresh diet",
  "flock.walkthrough.one.flight": "Research shows how beneficial flight is for birds, so we advocate for keeping them flighted whenever possible.",
  "flock.walkthrough.one.flightTitle": "Fully flighted birds",
  "flock.walkthrough.one.husbandry": "That means an appropriately sized cage, daily enrichment, plenty of foraging, and time out of the cage.",
  "flock.walkthrough.one.husbandryTitle": "Good husbandry",
  "flock.walkthrough.one.line": "Before you join, here's a quick look at what we're all about.",
  "flock.walkthrough.one.owners": "Parrot owners",
  "flock.walkthrough.one.researchers": "Researchers",
  "flock.walkthrough.one.tableBody": "We separate the issue from the person. We're all still learning, so wherever you and your bird are today, you're welcome here.",
  "flock.walkthrough.one.tableTitle": "Most importantly, we're building a bigger table",
  "flock.walkthrough.one.title": "Welcome to the Flock",
  "flock.walkthrough.one.training": "Research shows it's the best way to train and bond with a bird. We don't advocate for dominance or punishment-based methods.",
  "flock.walkthrough.one.trainingTitle": "Positive reinforcement training",
  "flock.walkthrough.progress": "{{step}} of {{total}}",
  "flock.walkthrough.promise1": "I'll be kind, and I'll give feedback only when someone asks for it.",
  "flock.walkthrough.promise2": "I'll flag anything that worries me instead of calling someone out.",
  "flock.walkthrough.promise3": "I'll follow science-based care and positive reinforcement training when I share.",
  "flock.walkthrough.promise4": "I'll take health questions to an avian vet.",
  "flock.walkthrough.promise5": "I won't sell, trade, or breed birds here.",
  "flock.walkthrough.promise6": "I understand that harassment and harmful content mean removal from the Flock.",
  "flock.walkthrough.three.agree": "I agree, take me to the Flock",
  "flock.walkthrough.three.failed": "We couldn't save that just now. Check your connection and tap the button again.",
  "flock.walkthrough.three.line": "This is what every member agrees to before coming in.",
  "flock.walkthrough.three.readFull": "Read the full guidelines →",
  "flock.walkthrough.three.saving": "Saving…",
  "flock.walkthrough.three.title": "Our promises to each other",
  "flock.walkthrough.two.feedback": "If someone asks, \"What do you think of my setup?\", share kind, honest ideas. If someone just shares a photo of their bird, celebrate the bird, and please don't pile on in the comments.",
  "flock.walkthrough.two.feedbackTitle": "We give feedback only when it's asked for",
  "flock.walkthrough.two.flag": "If something someone shares worries you, tap flag. The Kya team reviews every single one and reaches out privately, so nobody gets corrected in front of everyone.",
  "flock.walkthrough.two.flagTitle": "We flag it instead of calling it out",
  "flock.walkthrough.two.line": "This is what makes the Flock different.",
  "flock.walkthrough.two.private": "We never feature your posts or photos anywhere else without asking you first.",
  "flock.walkthrough.two.privateTitle": "What you share stays here",
  "flock.walkthrough.two.title": "How we look after each other",
  "flock.walkthrough.two.vet": "We never give medical advice here. You're welcome to share what's worked for you, but none of us are avian vets, and posts that give medical advice will be taken down.",
  "flock.walkthrough.two.vetTitle": "Health questions go to your vet",
